No. The stated reason is that no clinical endpoints exist at all in the registrations. The actual reason documented in the packet is that the specific clinical quantity *that this page pools* was not pre-specified (as seen in `which_limb_fails` and `outcomes[0].definition`). The packet supports this different, narrower reason which was not given in the text. 

**5. VERDICT**
